            "block_content": "Recall that an isolated singularity  $ \\beta \\in \\mathbb{C} $ is called a pole of order  $ m \\in \\mathbb{N} $ of the operator-valued function  $ Q(z) $ if  $ m $ is the minimal number such that the function",
